{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12652","headline":"系乐府十二首 贫妇词 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 贫妇词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁知苦贫夫，家有愁怨妻。\n请君听其词，能不爲酸凄。\n所怜抱中儿，不如山下麑。\n空念庭前地，化爲人吏蹊。\n出门望山泽，回头心复迷。\n何时见府主，长跪向之啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}